"With the download window off, downloads start right away. The app keeps running in the menu bar when its window is closed." = "Da tagar saukar da fayiloli bata aiki, saukar da fayiloli zai fara nan da nan. Shirin ayuka na ci gaba da tafiya a cikin layin mazaɓa idan aka rufe tagar.";
