"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "An ƙayyade iyakoki na gudu, haɗin ga kowanne torrent, tashoshi na aikawa da kuma rarrabawa ga kowanne torrent lokacin da ka ƙara shi, ko kuma bayan haka a ƙarƙashin Tsarin Torrent. Torrents na amfani da mai zaman kansu daga tabin Haɗin (HTTP ko SOCKS5, ko kuma mai zaman kansu na Mac tare da \"Ka Yi amfani da daidaitattun tsarin\") da kuma iyakacin gudu ga duk saukarwa. Canji zai yi tasiri ga duk torrents da aka fara daga baya. Masu haɗin kai da masu bincike za su iya ganin adireshin IP ɗinka, ko kuma na mai zaman kansu.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Shiryoyin da ake amfani da su ga duk saukewa daga wata rukunin yanar gizo. Wani rukunin yanar gizo kuma yana rufe sabbin shafukansa (misali.com yana rufe www.misali.com). Ankan aika da alamun shiga kawai zuwa wannan rukunin yanar gizo kuma ana kiyaye su tare da sauran sirrin shirin ayuka.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Wani madadin yana riƙe da ƙayyadaddun ka, ƙayyadaddun shafuka, ƙuƙumma da kuma jerin sauke-sauke. Babu yadda za'a sanya kalmomin shiga da kikis cikin wani madadin.";
"When you copy a link that ends in one of these types, the Add window opens with it." = "Idan ka kwafe wata alaƙa wadda ta ƙare da ɗaya daga cikin waɗannan nau'ikan, taga Ƙara za ta buɗe tare da ita.";
"Expected checksums are checked automatically when a download finishes. Queues can also quit the app, sleep or shut down the Mac when they are done (Scheduler)." = "An yi gwajin checksums da ake tsammani da kansu lokacin da wani sauke ya ƙare. Wuraren da ake tsammani kuma na iya fita daga shirin ayuka, yin barci ko kuma rufe Mac lokacin da aka gama su (Shirin).";
"Save the extension folder, open the browser's extensions page, switch on Developer mode, choose Load unpacked and pick the folder." = "Ka adana wannan maɓallin, ka buɗe shafi na maɓallan taswirar, ka kunna yanayin masu ƙerawa, ka zaɓa Load unpacked kuma ka zaɓa maɓallin.";
"Save the add-on file and drag it onto a Firefox window. Firefox installs add-ons that are signed; see the README for signing your copy." = "Ka kiyaye fayil ɗin canzawa kuma ka kwafa shi cikin taga Firefox. Firefox na shigar da canzawa waɗanda aka sanya hannu; ka duba README don sanya hannu kan kwafinka.";
"Install the ndm command, then for example: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night" = "Yi shigar da umarnin ndm, sa'an nan misali: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night";
